### Base Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

@studentId = 5346eebd-7f99-48ec-8a54-9ce14d6e7f92
@tutorId = 7b5eee9e-d5cc-4967-ab2e-5e85d78d15f2
@subjectId = a5c453bc-9f50-49b9-bbef-bdc0a141babc
@slotId = f12c5d13-4410-49d6-8dbf-1c16dc9967fa
@bookingId = 52dc708a-65c8-4b41-8878-b128034b7387

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION (Run these first to capture tokens automatically)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Login as Student
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "liam.student@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 2. Login as Tutor
# @name loginTutor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.math@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### DYNAMIC TOKENS (Extracted from login responses above)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
@tutorToken = {{loginTutor.response.body.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### BOOKING ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Create a Booking (Student Action)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "tutorId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "availabilitySlotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

###

### 4a. Get Bookings for Student Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/user
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4b. Get Bookings for Tutor Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/user
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5a. Update Booking Status - Cancel (Student Action)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

###

### 5b. Update Booking Status - Confirm (Tutor Action)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

###

### 6. Delete Booking Record (Tutor / Admin Action)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json